if showTip=0 {tip="Once you've got access to the Dark Woods you'll be able to finally face down the Dark One and end this war!"}
if showTip=1 {tip="Bomb Arrows can help deal with large groups of enemies that are close together in a pinch!"}
if showTip=2 {tip="If your Health is low might want to try Vampiric Arrows which raise your chance to Lifesteal from enemies!"}
if showTip=3 {tip="Go check the Crystal Cavern every few days, bound to find some good crafting materials and loot down there!"} 
if showTip=4 {tip="Keep an eye out for Mushrooms growing around the Tower, you can Harvest them for Gold and XP!"}
if showTip=5 {tip="Don't save your Items for a Rainy day, they might be the difference from surviving a wave and not!"}
if showTip=6 {tip="Economy has been rough since the Dark One started attacking villages. Learn to Craft Items instead of just buying them!"}
if showTip=7 {tip="Explore the World carefully, there are more then a few secrets to be found in Estaria!"}